<title>USA: Kevco Q4 proforma shr $0.35 vs $0.34.</title>
<headline>Kevco Q4 proforma shr $0.35 vs $0.34.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				     Three months ended</p>
<p>					  December 31,</p>
<p>				    1996		1995</p>
<p>Net sales		  $   62,296	$   63,504</p>
<p>Pro forma net income	  2,156	     1,683</p>
