<p>NOTE: The proforma net income and pro forma earanings per share for each period are presented as if the comany had been a C corporation for the entire period. The company converted from an S corporation to a C corporation upon its  initial publi offering on November 6, 1996.</p>
<p>Full company name is Kevco Inc.</p>
